Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["InfraUnion", "ObjectName",
 CellID->1224892054,ExpressionUUID->"8393d601-4014-44ba-afc9-60862df940ec"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"d613f38d-b865-4783-9664-812b02895ef1"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraUnion"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraUnion", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["graph", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["obj1", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["obj2", "TI"], ",", " ", "..."}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3da7f283-ad9c-44a1-a300-159793d2ee17"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "returns the vertex-set union of the given shapes on graph \[LongDash] \
vertex lists, densities, walk graphs \[LongDash] as a sorted List.",
 "\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"6daf0c41-a223-45bc-9d6f-2b140d796600"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraUnion"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraUnion", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["obj1", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["obj2", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "93c94a6f-8e35-4f15-a581-8647df582b6c"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "of two Euclidean heads is itself an inert head; InfraMeasurement evaluates \
it on a graph."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"91c6f5aa-fa45-4091-95f2-09878de2ccdb"],

Cell["\<\
On heads, InfraMeasurement gives the union its \"VertexDensity\" \[LongDash] \
the sum of the two densities \[LongDash] its \"Subgraph\" and the two \
measures. It is not a family of walks, so it has no \"Graph\", \
\"Cardinality\", \"Length\", \"EdgeDensity\" or \"Faithful\".\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"efec3e45-dca5-4c16-a29f-4f2273ee9a4e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Inside InfraScene hypotheses ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"InfraUnion", "[", 
   RowBox[{"c1", ",", " ", "c2"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "b4effb3e-96ed-4f8c-95c4-1c825c2c4b17"],
 " is the union token: every vertex of either object is one branch. It stays \
inert until the bindings resolve, the engine supplying the graph."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"594e0f19-390d-448a-9a10-c033f7594761"]
}, Open  ]],

